    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A — Upload a PDF\n1. Choose **Execute workflow** and submit the **UPLOAD PDF** form.\n2. Follow the green nodes and inspect **PDF indexed**.\n3. PDF is ingested into **pcai_n8n_pdf_demo**, not your existing production collection.\n4. You do **not** execute the Qdrant node by itself.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1110,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "87ca90ab-fcd3-419e-a9fa-7d50c12e3b29",
      "name": "HELP — A. Upload PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## B — Test directly in n8n (playground)\nClick **Open chat** (or open **TEST CHAT**) in the editor and ask a question about the PDF.\nAnswers appear in the chat window and under **Chat reply — Output** or **Executions**.\nAfter validation, the **same Chat Trigger** can serve Open WebUI; see README.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 1170,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "5afe89b6-7a77-441b-b7f0-b343f94c9a9b",
      "name": "HELP — B. Test Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        832
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configure before running\n**Qdrant**: choose the same Qdrant credential in INSERT and RETRIEVE. Both target the *new* demo collection.\n**EMBEDDER**: choose an OpenAI API credential with the Qwen MLIS **/v1** Base URL in BOTH embedding nodes; use the EXACT ID from /v1/models.\n**LLM**: choose a separate OpenAI API credential with the Gemma MLIS **/v1** Base URL; use its exact model ID; turn **Use Responses API** off.\n**Important**: n8n cannot work until these credentials and IDs are set.\n**PDF ingestion** requires a searchable, text-based PDF; scans need OCR.",
        "height": 510,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "397ee735-7de0-4d98-ad51-4bc3ff124939",
